# Blog Studio Implementation Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete GravityWrite-like Blog Studio with the following features:

### 1. AI Image Generation API
**File**: [api/generate-image.ts](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/api/generate-image.ts)

- Uses OpenRouter with Google Nano Banana model (`google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free`)
- Falls back to Unsplash placeholder images if AI generation unavailable
- Generates contextual images based on section heading and content

### 2. BlogSection Component
**File**: [src/components/BlogSection.tsx](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/src/components/BlogSection.tsx)

Features:
- Inline editing (click to edit heading/content)
- Per-section image generation
- Regenerate text/image buttons
- Section reordering (move up/down)
- Delete section

### 3. Updated OutrankSEO Page
**File**: [src/pages/OutrankSEO.tsx](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/src/pages/OutrankSEO.tsx)

Changes:
- Section-based editing instead of raw HTML preview
- "Add Images" button to generate images for all sections
- "Add Section" button to add new sections
- WordPress publish controls inline (draft/publish mode)
- Connection status indicator

### 4. WordPress Integration (Activated)
**File**: [api/integrations/wordpress/publish.ts](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/api/integrations/wordpress/publish.ts)

- Supports `status: 'draft'` or `status: 'publish'`
- Uses Nango for OAuth token management
- Full error handling and logging

